<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 359 0 R
/T (Short answer: We never hardcode secrets in code, Jenkinsfiles or Docker images. CI secrets live in the Jenkins Credentials store or in an external vault like AWS Secrets Manager or HashiCorp Vault. Application secrets at runtime come from Kubernetes Secrets, ideally synced from the external vault. We follow least privilege and rotate secrets regularly.)
/E (Short answer: We never hardcode secrets in code, Jenkinsfiles or Docker images. CI secrets live in the Jenkins Credentials store or in an external vault like AWS Secrets Manager or HashiCorp Vault. Application secrets at runtime come from Kubernetes Secrets, ideally synced from the external vault. We follow least privilege and rotate secrets regularly.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
