/T (Short answer: SonarQube itself does not stop Jenkins. Jenkins sends the analysis, SonarQube processes it in the background, and then SonarQube calls a webhook back to Jenkins with the Quality Gate result. The waitForQualityGate step receives that result, and with abortPipeline: true it marks the pipeline as failed.)
/E (Short answer: SonarQube itself does not stop Jenkins. Jenkins sends the analysis, SonarQube processes it in the background, and then SonarQube calls a webhook back to Jenkins with the Quality Gate result. The waitForQualityGate step receives that result, and with abortPipeline: true it marks the pipeline as failed.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
