<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 363 0 R
/T (Short answer: First I measure which stages take the most time. Then I run independent stages in parallel, cache dependencies and Docker layers, use faster or more agents, and only build what changed. In my project, these steps brought a 40-minute pipeline down to around 12 minutes.)
/E (Short answer: First I measure which stages take the most time. Then I run independent stages in parallel, cache dependencies and Docker layers, use faster or more agents, and only build what changed. In my project, these steps brought a 40-minute pipeline down to around 12 minutes.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
