/T (Hands-on experience: One morning, many builds failed with No space left on device. The console log pointed to the Docker build stage. I checked the agent and found old Docker images filling the disk. I cleaned them with docker system prune -af, re-ran the builds, and then added a scheduled cleanup job and a disk-space alert so it would not happen again.)
/E (Hands-on experience: One morning, many builds failed with No space left on device. The console log pointed to the Docker build stage. I checked the agent and found old Docker images filling the disk. I cleaned them with docker system prune -af, re-ran the builds, and then added a scheduled cleanup job and a disk-space alert so it would not happen again.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
