/T (Hands-on experience: Our pipeline took about 40 minutes. Stage timings showed that Maven downloads took 10 minutes and tests ran one after another. I added a Nexus proxy and persistent .m2 cache, ran unit tests and SonarQube in parallel, reordered the Dockerfile for layer caching, and moved slow integration tests to a nightly job. The pipeline dropped to about 12 minutes.)
/E (Hands-on experience: Our pipeline took about 40 minutes. Stage timings showed that Maven downloads took 10 minutes and tests ran one after another. I added a Nexus proxy and persistent .m2 cache, ran unit tests and SonarQube in parallel, reordered the Dockerfile for layer caching, and moved slow integration tests to a nightly job. The pipeline dropped to about 12 minutes.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
