937 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 368 0 R
/T (Short answer: A label is a tag we give to agents, like linux, docker, maven or windows. In the pipeline we ask for a label, and Jenkins runs the job only on agents with that label. It is how we send the right work to the right machine.)
/E (Short answer: A label is a tag we give to agents, like linux, docker, maven or windows. In the pipeline we ask for a label, and Jenkins runs the job only on agents with that label. It is how we send the right work to the right machine.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
