<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 368 0 R
/T (Hands-on experience: Early in my project, we used agent any. Sometimes builds landed on the built-in node \(the controller\), which slowed Jenkins down and was a security risk. We changed the controller's executors to 0, and used labels like maven and docker so builds always ran on the right agents.)
/E (Hands-on experience: Early in my project, we used agent any. Sometimes builds landed on the built-in node \(the controller\), which slowed Jenkins down and was a security risk. We changed the controller's executors to 0, and used labels like maven and docker so builds always ran on the right agents.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
