/T (Short answer: I keep each microservice independent: its own repo or folder, its own pipeline, its own Docker image and version. A Shared Library holds the common pipeline logic. CI builds, tests, scans and pushes the image. CD is done with GitOps: Jenkins updates the image tag in a manifest repo, and ArgoCD deploys to Kubernetes, environment by environment.)
/E (Short answer: I keep each microservice independent: its own repo or folder, its own pipeline, its own Docker image and version. A Shared Library holds the common pipeline logic. CI builds, tests, scans and pushes the image. CD is done with GitOps: Jenkins updates the image tag in a manifest repo, and ArgoCD deploys to Kubernetes, environment by environment.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [0]
>>
