1105 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 373 0 R
/T (Hands-on experience: In my project, each of our ~25 services had a short Jenkinsfile calling the shared library. A push to main built the image, pushed it to ECR with the commit SHA as the tag, and updated envs/dev/values.yaml in the GitOps repo. ArgoCD deployed it to the Dev namespace within a minute. Promotion to production was a PR in the GitOps repo, approved by the release manager.)
