/E (Short answer: Both are time-based triggers using cron syntax. Poll SCM checks Git on a schedule and builds only if there are new commits. Build Periodically builds on a schedule whether or not code changed. Today, for code changes we prefer webhooks; Build Periodically is used for nightly or scheduled jobs.)
