/T (Short answer: For user input, we use the parameters block: string, choice, boolean, and so on. The job then shows Build with Parameters, and we read values with params.NAME. For variables, we use the environment block, withEnv, or set env.VAR inside a script block. Secrets come from credentials, not parameters.)
