/T (Short answer: The common ones I handled were: disk full on the controller or agents, agents going offline, credential errors, plugin compatibility problems after upgrades, webhook triggers not working, slow pipelines, and SonarQube Quality Gate timeouts. For each, I fixed the root cause and added prevention like monitoring, cleanup and testing upgrades in staging.)
/E (Short answer: The common ones I handled were: disk full on the controller or agents, agents going offline, credential errors, plugin compatibility problems after upgrades, webhook triggers not working, slow pipelines, and SonarQube Quality Gate timeouts. For each, I fixed the root cause and added prevention like monitoring, cleanup and testing upgrades in staging.)
