/T (Short answer: Everything is stored in JENKINS_HOME, which is /var/lib/jenkins by default for Linux package installs. It holds the main config.xml, job configs, build history, plugins, credentials and secret keys. Service-level settings like Java options and port are in the systemd service configuration.)
