1989 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 402 0 R
/T (Short answer: I used Jenkins for CI and ArgoCD for CD. We chose Jenkins because it is very flexible, has plugins for everything in our stack, runs inside our own AWS network, and the team already had experience with it. ArgoCD handled Kubernetes deployments using GitOps, which gave us easy rollback and a clear audit trail.)
/E (Short answer: I used Jenkins for CI and ArgoCD for CD. We chose Jenkins because it is very flexible, has plugins for everything in our stack, runs inside our own AWS network, and the team already had experience with it. ArgoCD handled Kubernetes deployments using GitOps, which gave us easy rollback and a clear audit trail.)
/Pg 60 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
