/T (Honest trade-offs: Jenkins needs maintenance: upgrades, plugins, backups and security patches. Tools like GitHub Actions or GitLab CI are easier to start with and are managed for you. For a new small project with code in GitHub, GitHub Actions can be a good fit. Why ArgoCD for CD: the desired state lives in Git, ArgoCD keeps the cluster in sync, detects drift, and rollback is just a Git revert.)
/E (Honest trade-offs: Jenkins needs maintenance: upgrades, plugins, backups and security patches. Tools like GitHub Actions or GitLab CI are easier to start with and are managed for you. For a new small project with code in GitHub, GitHub Actions can be a good fit. Why ArgoCD for CD: the desired state lives in Git, ArgoCD keeps the cluster in sync, detects drift, and rollback is just a Git revert.)
/Pg 60 0 R
/K [11]
>>
