2550 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 419 0 R
/T (Hands-on experience: In my project, Jenkins agents ran as pods on a separate EKS node group. For deployments, Jenkins had no access to the production cluster at all. It only pushed tag changes to the GitOps repo, and ArgoCD inside the cluster applied them. This removed a big security risk: production cluster credentials stored in Jenkins.)
/E (Hands-on experience: In my project, Jenkins agents ran as pods on a separate EKS node group. For deployments, Jenkins had no access to the production cluster at all. It only pushed tag changes to the GitOps repo, and ArgoCD inside the cluster applied them. This removed a big security risk: production cluster credentials stored in Jenkins.)
/Pg 77 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
