/T (Hands-on experience: One Monday, all pushes to Nexus failed with 401. The service account password had been rotated by the security team over the weekend, but the Jenkins credential wasn't updated. I updated the credential with the same ID, re-ran the failed builds, and we added Jenkins to the rotation checklist. Later we moved the password into AWS Secrets Manager, synced into Jenkins, so rotation updated it automatically.)
/E (Hands-on experience: One Monday, all pushes to Nexus failed with 401. The service account password had been rotated by the security team over the weekend, but the Jenkins credential wasn't updated. I updated the credential with the same ID, re-ran the failed builds, and we added Jenkins to the rotation checklist. Later we moved the password into AWS Secrets Manager, synced into Jenkins, so rotation updated it automatically.)
/Pg 82 0 R
/K [21]
>>
