2712 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 425 0 R
/T (Short answer: In the pipeline, I add an input step before the production stage. The pipeline pauses and only users or groups listed in submitter can click Proceed or Abort. I wrap it in a timeout so it doesn't wait forever, and I run it without holding an agent. For pure manual jobs, I restrict "Build" permission to the release team using RBAC. Explanation)
/E (Short answer: In the pipeline, I add an input step before the production stage. The pipeline pauses and only users or groups listed in submitter can click Proceed or Abort. I wrap it in a timeout so it doesn't wait forever, and I run it without holding an agent. For pure manual jobs, I restrict "Build" permission to the release team using RBAC. Explanation)
/Pg 83 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
