/E (Hands-on experience: Our Maven stage took 14 minutes on Kubernetes pod agents. The log showed about 8 minutes of dependency downloads, because each pod started with an empty .m2. I added a shared cache volume and pointed Maven to our Nexus proxy in the same VPC. The stage dropped to around 4 minutes.)
/Pg 86 0 R
/K [1]
>>
