/T (Short answer: If the same pipeline works in Dev but not in Prod, the code is probably fine and something in the environment is different. I compare the two environments side by side: credentials and permissions, configuration and secrets, network access, resource limits, the agent used, the image version, and cluster policies. I find the difference, fix it, and make environments more consistent.)
/E (Short answer: If the same pipeline works in Dev but not in Prod, the code is probably fine and something in the environment is different. I compare the two environments side by side: credentials and permissions, configuration and secrets, network access, resource limits, the agent used, the image version, and cluster policies. I find the difference, fix it, and make environments more consistent.)
/Pg 87 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
