/Title (Short answer: My first priority is to restore service, so I roll back to 1.1 immediately. Then I inform the team and stakeholders. After production is stable, I investigate 1.2 in a lower environment, find the root cause, fix it, and release a corrected version like 1.2.1 through the normal pipeline. Finally, we do a blameless post-mortem and add checks to catch this earlier.)
/Dest [90 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 6724 0 R
/Next 7092 0 R
>>
endobj
