7093 0 obj
<<
/Title (Hands-on experience: Version 1.2 of our orders service failed because new pods crashed on startup. The new version expected a config value that existed only in staging. I rolled back to 1.1 via a GitOps revert within minutes, confirmed metrics were normal, then added the missing value to production config and released 1.2.1 the next day. We added a startup config validation to catch it earlier.)
/Dest [90 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5950 0 R
/Prev 6725 0 R
/Next 7121 0 R
>>
