/Title (Short answer: We define who must approve and how many approvals are needed, based on the change risk. In Jenkins, the input step with submitter limits approval to the release managers group, and we can chain two input steps when two different teams must approve. In GitOps, approvals are pull request reviews on the production folder, with CODEOWNERS and a required number of reviewers. Every approval is recorded for audit. How we decide the approvals)
/Dest [92 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5956 0 R
/Prev 7100 0 R
/First 7129 0 R
/Last 7130 0 R
/Count -6
/Next 6733 0 R
>>
endobj
