/Title (Short answer: If the same pipeline works in Dev but not in Prod, the code is probably fine and something in the environment is different. I compare the two environments side by side: credentials and permissions, configuration and secrets, network access, resource limits, the agent used, the image version, and cluster policies. I find the difference, fix it, and make environments more consistent.)
/Dest [87 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7145 0 R
/Next 7171 0 R
>>
endobj
