<<
/Title (Short answer: Stages in a Declarative pipeline run in order, and if the build stage fails, Jenkins stops and skips the next stages automatically. So I put Test after Build and make sure build commands return a non-zero exit code on failure. I avoid hiding errors with things like || true. For unstable builds, I use skipStagesAfterUnstable\(\) or a when condition.)
/Dest [74 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7597 0 R
/Next 7667 0 R
>>
