/Title (Short answer: I wrote a Declarative Jenkinsfile for our Java microservices. It checks out the code, builds and tests with Maven, runs SonarQube and waits for the Quality Gate, builds a Docker image tagged with the commit ID, scans it with Trivy, pushes it to ECR, and then updates the image tag in our GitOps repo so ArgoCD deploys it to Dev. It sends Slack notifications and cleans the workspace at the end.)
