<<
/Title (Honest trade-offs: Jenkins needs maintenance: upgrades, plugins, backups and security patches. Tools like GitHub Actions or GitLab CI are easier to start with and are managed for you. For a new small project with code in GitHub, GitHub Actions can be a good fit. Why ArgoCD for CD: the desired state lives in Git, ArgoCD keeps the cluster in sync, detects drift, and rollback is just a Git revert.)
/Dest [60 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 8350 0 R
/Prev 8464 0 R
/Next 8388 0 R
