/Title (Hands-on experience: In my project, creating a new QA environment was a manual task that took half a day. I automated it with a parameterized pipeline: it ran Terraform to create the namespace resources and RDS database, applied the Helm chart, ran smoke tests, and posted the URL to Slack. It took 15 minutes, and anyone in the QA team could run it.)
/Dest [42 0 R /Fit]
