/Title (Short answer: Every microservice repo has one Multibranch job. Jenkins discovers all branches and PRs automatically. Feature branches and PRs run CI only, main deploys to Dev, and release branches or tags go to staging and production with approval. All of this is controlled by one Jenkinsfile using when conditions.)
/Dest [55 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 8965 0 R
/Prev 9014 0 R
>>
